{"id":"14088421136f8182","group":"28","path":"28/28-df-poly-reduction.md","title":"Polynomial-Time Many-One Reduction","display":"df-poly-reduction — Polynomial-Time Many-One Reduction","type":"definition","metadata":{"book":"Computational Complexity: A Modern Approach","book_abbrev":"28","depends_on":["[[28-df-polynomial-time-function]]"],"display":"df-poly-reduction — Polynomial-Time Many-One Reduction","label":"28-df-poly-reduction","aliases":["28-df-poly-reduction"],"type":"definition"},"metadataError":null,"renderWarnings":[],"properties":[{"key":"book","html":"Computational Complexity: A Modern Approach"},{"key":"book_abbrev","html":"28"},{"key":"depends_on","html":"<div class=\"property-array\"><span><a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-1\" data-note=\"adb92775ec020a0b\" href=\"?note=adb92775ec020a0b\" title=\"28-df-polynomial-time-function\">28-df-polynomial-time-function</a></span></div>"},{"key":"display","html":"df-poly-reduction — Polynomial-Time Many-One Reduction"},{"key":"label","html":"28-df-poly-reduction"},{"key":"aliases","html":"<div class=\"property-array\"><span>28-df-poly-reduction</span></div>"},{"key":"type","html":"definition"}],"html":"\n<h2 id=\"Hypothesis\">[Hypothesis]</h2>\n<ul>\n<li><span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"A,B\\subseteq\\{0,1\\}^*\">\\(A,B\\subseteq\\{0,1\\}^*\\)</span> (语言)</li>\n<li><span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\mathbf{FP}\">\\(\\mathbf{FP}\\)</span> (多项式时间可计算函数类, see <a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-2\" data-note=\"adb92775ec020a0b\" href=\"?note=adb92775ec020a0b\" title=\"28-df-polynomial-time-function\">28-df-polynomial-time-function</a>)</li>\n<li><span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\leq_m^{\\mathbf{P}}\">\\(\\leq_m^{\\mathbf{P}}\\)</span> (多项式时间多一归约关系)</li>\n</ul>\n<h2 id=\"Assertion\">[Assertion]</h2>\n<figure class=\"equation\" data-tex=\"A\\leq_m^{\\mathbf{P}}B\\leftrightarrow\\exists f\\in\\mathbf{FP}\\;\\forall x\\in\\{0,1\\}^*\\;(x\\in A\\leftrightarrow f(x)\\in B)\"><div class=\"math-display\" tabindex=\"0\" role=\"region\" aria-label=\"数学公式\">\\[A\\leq_m^{\\mathbf{P}}B\\leftrightarrow\\exists f\\in\\mathbf{FP}\\;\\forall x\\in\\{0,1\\}^*\\;(x\\in A\\leftrightarrow f(x)\\in B)\\]</div><button class=\"equation-action\" type=\"button\" aria-label=\"展开查看完整公式\">展开公式 ↗</button></figure><h2 id=\"Remark\">[Remark]</h2>\n<p>来源核对：定义2.7；印刷42页；PDF68页。全函数、多项式时间和双向成员资格已核对。</p>\n","headings":[{"id":"Hypothesis","text":"[Hypothesis]","level":2},{"id":"Assertion","text":"[Assertion]","level":2},{"id":"Remark","text":"[Remark]","level":2}],"links":[{"target":"28-df-polynomial-time-function","status":"resolved","id":"adb92775ec020a0b","anchor":"ref-1","targetAnchor":"","location":"元数据 · depends_on","heading":"","excerpt":"[[28-df-polynomial-time-function]]","embed":false},{"target":"28-df-polynomial-time-function","status":"resolved","id":"adb92775ec020a0b","anchor":"ref-2","targetAnchor":"","location":"正文","heading":"[Hypothesis]","excerpt":"$\\mathbf{FP}$ (多项式时间可计算函数类, see [[28-df-polynomial-time-function]])","embed":false}],"attachments":[],"math":[{"tex":"A,B\\subseteq\\{0,1\\}^*","display":false},{"tex":"\\mathbf{FP}","display":false},{"tex":"\\leq_m^{\\mathbf{P}}","display":false},{"tex":"A\\leq_m^{\\mathbf{P}}B\\leftrightarrow\\exists f\\in\\mathbf{FP}\\;\\forall x\\in\\{0,1\\}^*\\;(x\\in A\\leftrightarrow f(x)\\in B)","display":true}],"bytes":810,"backlinks":[{"id":"adbd423ba4d39b96","anchor":"ref-4","locations":["元数据 · depends_on","正文"],"count":2,"excerpt":"$\\leq_m^{\\mathbf{P}}$ (多项式时间多一归约, see [[28-df-poly-reduction]])"},{"id":"a39964177c0e0048","anchor":"ref-4","locations":["元数据 · depends_on","正文"],"count":2,"excerpt":"$\\mathbf{PSPACE}$ 见 [[28-df-pspace]]，$\\le_m^{\\mathbf P}$ 见 [[28-df-poly-reduction]]。"},{"id":"61dee9752dab3b61","anchor":"ref-39","locations":["正文"],"count":1,"excerpt":"归约：[[28-df-polynomial-time-function]]、[[28-df-poly-reduction]]、[[28-thm-poly-reduction-transitive]]、[[28-df-np-hard]]、[[28-df-np-complete]]、[[28-df-p-complete]]。"},{"id":"31857d